claim.claim-text:
the transition frequency of the fixed-frequency qubit device and the transition frequency of the tunable qubit device;
the transition frequency of the fixed-frequency qubit device and the anharmonicity of the tunable qubit device;
the transition frequency between the ground state and first excited state of the fixed-frequency qubit device; or,
the transition frequency between the first excited state and second excited state of the fixed-frequency qubit device.
